module handed_free_fn.neg_3

// A free function of a std module called WITHOUT an import (registry 221.1
// #1493, D29): a name of another module is visible only through `import
// <module>.{<name>}`. `pos_1` beside this file calls the same function after
// importing it. Until #1493 novac resolved the call by its bare name over a flat
// table and printed `true`, where the oracle says "undefined identifier".
// Both compilers refuse now.

// NOVAC_EXPECT undefined identifier `is_high_surrogate`: it is declared in module

fn main() {
    println(is_high_surrogate(0xD800))
}
